#: ui/cryptopage.ui:26
msgid ""
"Protect yourself against surveillance by encrypting your Mails with GnuPG. "
"By generating or selecting a public / private key pair now mails can be "
"encrypted using the public key while only you can decrypt them with your "
"private key."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, enableCryptoCheckBox)
#: ui/cryptopage.ui:52
msgid ""
"When sending mails KMail automatically looks for encryption keys of your "
"recipients and secures the mail when keys for each recipient can be found. "
"It also signs your mails cryptographically so that it can be verified that "
"your messages have not been tampered with."
msgstr ""

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, enableCryptoCheckBox)
#: ui/cryptopage.ui:55
